WEBVTT

00:04.680 --> 00:06.080
This edict...

00:06.440 --> 00:07.840
I fear is far from simple.

00:07.920 --> 00:09.320
What do you mean?

00:09.400 --> 00:11.240
If Imperial Father were truly gravely ill,

00:11.320 --> 00:13.200
And urgently summoned me back to the capital now,

00:13.280 --> 00:14.680
It must mean...
